<hr>

\section TripDecision Trip Decision Metrics

RCD trip decisions are typically based on one or more of the following metrics:
- RMS residual current exceeding \f$ I_{\Delta n} \f$
- Instantaneous magnitude exceeding threshold
- Integrated current exceeding energy‑based limits
- Time above threshold

These metrics are evaluated against **regulatory trip curves**
that define maximum allowable disconnection times.

<hr>

